\section{Formal Proof Validation Architecture: Beyond Doubt}
\label{sec:formal_proof_validation}

\subsection{Architectural Overview}

To establish proof validation ``beyond the shadow of a doubt,'' we
construct a multi-layered verification framework integrating:

\begin{enumerate}
    \item Automated Theorem Proving (ATP),
    \item Zero-Knowledge Proof (ZKP) generation,
    \item Cryptographic commitment anchoring,
    \item Continuous Lyapunov stability monitoring.
\end{enumerate}

This architecture eliminates epistemological ambiguity by combining
formal logic, cryptographic hardness, and dynamical-system invariants
into a single unified validation pipeline.

